<title>USA: Ford December US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Ford December US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co</p>
<p>			Dec 1-31, 1996     Dec 1-31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   125,074	   123,866	     +1.0</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 172,580	   144,573	    +19.4</p>
<p> Import Car		 1,555	     2,024	    -23.2</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Dec 31, 1996 Jan 1-Dec 31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	 1,699,893	 1,732,034	     -2.5</p>
<p> Domestic Truck     2,106,186	 2,009,755	     +4.1</p>
<p> Import Car		37,359	    59,191	    -37.3</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 308 for year to date vs 306 in year ago.</p>
</text>
